    "body": "## `cargo xtask gate light` at `c2399c040`\n\nThe review at `c2399c040` did not list this step. The result completes the step.\n\nMerge with `main` `940cc5d0`: clean, no conflict. Merge commit `3382da9f`.\n\n| Step | Result |\n|---|---|\n| light build (release `--no-run`) | ok, 767 s |\n| motion light: lib | ok, 7 passed |\n| motion light: adaptive_troch_island | ok, 1 passed |\n| motion light: adaptive_troch_neck | ok, 1 passed |\n| motion light: adaptive_troch_parallel | ok, 1 passed |\n| app light: pocket_pass_start | ok, 1 passed |\n\n6 steps, 11 light twins, 0 failed, 0 stalled, wall 18.2 min. No red twin, so there is no full heavy command to run.\n\n`git status --short -- crates/app/tests/golden` is empty. The bump changes no golden output.\n",
